+E=(3c_*/2)Z+(3Z^2-1)sigma.
+```
+
+For `[A^1]E`, direct collection before substitution gives
+
+```text
+-3KC +(3KZ/2)C' -KE' +6D(3Z^2-1)-12ZL+2KZ=0.
+```
+
+Substituting the preceding parametrization reduces the first three terms to
