+=-6s^2 Z^(2n+2),
+```
+
+where `s=lc(sigma)` and `n=m+1`. This is the claimed
+`-6lc(sigma)^2 Z^(2m+4)`. The right side of (3.6) has degree at most
+`max(m,1)`, so cancellation is impossible.
